  "90 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 26 min of vigorous work a week. Some muscle soreness is expected; joint pain is not. Still sore after 48 hours? Repeat sessions before moving up.": "90 minuta planirane zone 2 i oko 26 minuta intenzivnog rada tjedno. Očekuje se određena bol u mišićima; bolovi u zglobovima nisu. Još uvijek boli nakon 48 sati? Ponovite sesije prije pomicanja prema gore.",
