  "At easier levels, move slowly until you learn the movement.": "Na lakšim razinama krećite se polako dok ne naučite pokret.",
  "At least 120 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 51 min of hard cardio a week; controlled vigorous blocks on Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday.": "Najmanje 120 minuta planirane Zone 2 i oko 51 minuta napornog kardija tjedno; kontrolirani snažni blokovi u utorak, četvrtak i subotu.",
  "At New to training and Returning, keep the pace brisk and below all-out effort. At Active, work hard. At Well trained, use all-out effort.": "At New to training and Returning, držite tempo žustar i ispod potpunog napora. At Active, marljivo radi. At Well trained, uloži sve od sebe.",
  "At Returning and above, hold a dumbbell in each hand, or loop a band around your waist with its anchor in front of you. The band should pull you forward, like a sled.": "At Returning and above, držite bučicu u svakoj ruci ili omotajte traku oko struka sa sidrom ispred sebe. Bend bi te trebao vući naprijed, kao sanjke.",
  "At Returning, push back up with your hands. At higher levels, pull yourself back with your hamstrings.": "At Returning, gurnite se prema gore rukama. At higher levels, povucite se unatrag tetivama koljena.",
  "At the end of your last interval, note your peak heart rate. Walk gently for 60 seconds and note your heart rate again. Enter the drop (peak minus 60s reading).": "Na kraju posljednjeg intervala zabilježite svoj maksimalni broj otkucaja srca. Lagano hodajte 60 sekundi i ponovno zabilježite otkucaje srca. Unesite pad (vršno očitanje minus 60 s).",
