  "Blueprint's title block names the exercise, and it dimensions steps and boxes only when there is one. Doodle has jokes for each kind of exercise and tallies the reps as they're counted; its speech bubble no longer covers the figure.": "Naslovni blok Blueprinta imenuje vježbu i dimenzionira korake i okvire samo ako ih ima. Doodle ima šale za svaku vrstu vježbe i zbraja ponavljanja dok se broje; njegov govorni balon više ne prekriva lik.",
