  "Bryan adds a weighted vest during Zone 2 walks and hikes to increase axial bone loading safely.": "Bryan dodaje prsluk s utezima tijekom šetnji i planinarenja Zone 2 kako bi sigurno povećao aksijalno opterećenje kostiju.",
  "Bryan calls the phone the worst trigger for bad posture. Hold it at eye level and put the top of your monitor at eye level too.": "Bryan telefon naziva najgorim okidačem za loše držanje. Držite ga u razini očiju i stavite gornji dio monitora u razinu očiju.",
  "Bryan calls this technical and was taught it for his own diagnosed condition. Stay gentle, and stop if you get dizziness, tingling or a headache.": "Bryan to naziva tehničkim i tome ga je naučio zbog vlastite dijagnoze stanja. Ostanite nježni i prestanite ako osjetite vrtoglavicu, trnce ili glavobolju.",
  "Bryan demo with timestamp": "Bryan demo s vremenskom oznakom",
  "Bryan demonstrates it at {time} ({clock})": "Bryan to demonstrira na {time} ({clock})",
  "Bryan did 1 × 10 in 2023. His 2025 Galpin session includes Nordic curls in the strength block. They protect against hamstring strains.": "Bryan je 2023. napravio 1 × 10. Njegov Galpin trening 2025. uključuje nordijske pregibe u bloku snage. Štite od istegnuća tetive koljena.",
  "Bryan does “butterfly pulls” with a resistance band, 1 × 15. Most write-ups describe it as a band chest fly; watch his clip to copy his exact version.": "Bryan radi \"butterfly pulls\" s otpornom trakom, 1 × 15. Većina zapisa to opisuje kao band chest fly; pogledajte njegov isječak da kopirate njegovu točnu verziju.",
  "Bryan does 3 × 10 per leg, learned from Ben Patrick, the Knees-Over-Toes coach working with him on his 2026 dunk project. It builds the inner quad (VMO) and knee resilience.": "Bryan radi 3 × 10 po nozi, saznao je od Bena Patricka, trenera Knees-Over-Toes koji radi s njim na njegovom projektu zakucavanja 2026. Gradi otpornost unutarnjeg četveroglavca (VMO) i koljena.",
  "Bryan does both grips": "Bryan radi oba zahvata",
  "Bryan does both. His 2025 Galpin session includes them in the strength block at 2 × 5–8. His official beginner list uses assisted pull-ups.": "Bryan radi oboje. Njegova Galpin sesija 2025. uključuje ih u blok snage na 2 × 5–8. Njegov službeni popis početnika koristi potpomognuta povlačenja.",
  "Bryan does the Pallof press in his 2025 session with Dr. Andy Galpin. It trains the trunk to resist twisting.": "Bryan radi Pallof press na svojoj seansi 2025. s dr. Andyjem Galpinom. Trenira trup da se odupre uvijanju.",
  "Bryan does tibialis raises (1 × 25, single-leg in his list). His 2026 dunk notes mention limited ankle dorsiflexion. This exercise works on that movement.": "Bryan diže tibialis (1 × 25, jedna noga na njegovom popisu). Njegove bilješke o zakucavanjima iz 2026. spominju ograničenu dorzalnu fleksiju gležnja. Ova vježba djeluje na taj pokret.",
  "Bryan has been training to dunk at 49 since July 2026, using heavy lifts with jumps between sets. He says he needs more fast-twitch fibres and faster force development, and warns about Achilles risk from landing forces. Learn to land before working on height.": "Bryan trenira zakucavanje na 49 od srpnja 2026., koristeći teška dizanja sa skokovima između serija. Kaže da mu treba više brzih vlakana i brži razvoj sile, te upozorava na Ahilov rizik od sila koje se spuštaju. Naučite sletjeti prije rada na visini.",
  "Bryan Johnson": "Bryan Johnson",
  "Bryan Johnson · Jul 18, 2023": "Bryan Johnson · 18. srpnja 2023",
