  "Bryan: 60+ strict continuous reps (chest to floor, zero top pauses). Harvard study: 40+ push-ups correlated with 96% lower cardiovascular events.": "Bryan: 60+ striktnih kontinuiranih ponavljanja (prsa do poda, nula gornjih pauza). Studija Harvarda: 40+ sklekova u korelaciji s 96% nižim kardiovaskularnim događajima.",
