  "Bryan: seated calf raises 1 × 25. The standing single-leg version adds Achilles preparation for jumping, his own 2026 concern.": "Bryan: podiže tele u sjedećem položaju 1 × 25. Verzija s jednom nogom u stojećem položaju dodaje Ahileju pripremu za skok, što je njegova briga 2026.",
  "Bryan: to fatigue, 2×/wk": "Bryan: do umora, 2×/tjedno",
  "Bryan’s 2025 Galpin session includes these in the speed and power block (2 × 5). You need about 2 m of clear floor to move sideways.": "Bryanova Galpin sesija 2025. uključuje ih u bloku brzine i snage (2 × 5). Za bočno kretanje potrebno vam je oko 2 m čistog poda.",
  "Bryan’s 2025 session has a rotational power slot (2 × 5), and his Bone Density protocol lists medicine-ball throws. Use a fast band chop at home.": "Bryanova sesija 2025. ima rotacijski power slot (2 × 5), a njegov protokol Bone Density navodi bacanja medicinske lopte. Upotrijebite brzo sjeckanje s trakom kod kuće.",
  "Bryan’s 2026 dunk training is built on heavy pulls (a 385 lb, about 175 kg, PR on 4 Sep 2026, followed straight away by jumps), and his bone protocol names deadlifts. The dumbbell Romanian deadlift provides the heavy hip-hinge work in this plan.": "Bryanov trening zakucavanja 2026. izgrađen je na teškim povlačenjima (385 lb, oko 175 kg, PR 4. rujna 2026., nakon čega odmah slijede skokovi), a njegov protokol za kosti zove se mrtvo dizanje. Rumunjsko mrtvo dizanje s bučicama pruža težak rad na kukovima u ovom planu.",
  "Bryan’s Bone Density protocol (Apr 2026) puts jumping and hopping into the warm-up 4–7 times a week. He mentions stiff tendons and Achilles risk in his 2026 dunk training notes. This plan gives the tendons a small daily dose of work.": "Bryanov protokol gustoće kostiju (travanj 2026.) stavlja skakanje i poskakivanje u zagrijavanje 4-7 puta tjedno. Spominje ukočene tetive i Ahilov rizik u svojim bilješkama s treninga zakucavanja 2026. godine. Ovaj plan daje tetivama malu dnevnu dozu rada.",
  "Bryan’s Bone Density protocol (Apr 2026): high ground-reaction shockwaves stimulate osteoblast mineral deposition to maintain 99th percentile bone density.": "Bryanov protokol gustoće kostiju (travanj 2026.): visoki udarni valovi reakcije na tlo stimuliraju taloženje minerala osteoblasta kako bi se održala gustoća kostiju od 99. percentila.",
  "Bryan’s Friday session in his newest weekly template (exercise newsletter, 4 Oct 2026) includes step-ups at 3 × 10 per leg. His bone protocol also uses box step-ups for power training.": "Bryanova sesija petkom u njegovom najnovijem tjednom predlošku (bilten o vježbanju, 4. listopada 2026.) uključuje korake od 3 × 10 po nozi. Njegov protokol za kosti također koristi korake u kutiji za trening snage.",
  "Bryan’s Friday template: lunges, overhead press, chest press, step-ups and side planks. Start with power work in Galpin’s order, then use Bryan’s 2026 pairing of heavy hip hinges followed by jumps.": "Bryanov predložak za petak: iskoraci, potisak iznad glave, potisak na prsa, iskoraci i bočne daske. Započnite s radom na snazi ​​prema Galpinovom redoslijedu, a zatim upotrijebite Bryanovo uparivanje teških bokova iz 2026. nakon čega slijede skokovi.",
  "Bryan’s guide says holding good posture uses muscles that may feel sore at first. Sharp pain, tingling or headaches are reasons to stop and get checked.": "Bryanov vodič kaže da držanje dobrog položaja koristi mišiće koji bi u početku mogli osjetiti bol. Oštra bol, trnci ili glavobolja razlog su da prestanete i idete na pregled.",
  "Bryan's gym exercise": "Bryanova vježba u teretani",
  "Bryan’s mobility and strength exercises, including pulling, Knees-Over-Toes work and high-rep arm work, followed by Zone 2 toward his weekly target. This is the first of two posture strength days.": "Bryanove vježbe mobilnosti i snage, uključujući povlačenje, rad s koljenima iznad nožnih prstiju i rad s rukama s velikim brojem ponavljanja, nakon čega slijedi Zona 2 prema njegovom tjednom cilju. Ovo je prvi od dva dana za jačanje držanja.",
  "Bryan’s official light day: 20–30 min of gentle yoga or stretching.": "Bryanov službeni lagani dan: 20-30 minuta nježne joge ili istezanja.",
  "Bryan’s official list: arm circles, wall slides, thread the needle, hip CARs.": "Bryanov službeni popis: krugovi za ruke, tobogani, konac u iglu, CAR-ovi za kukove.",
  "Bryan’s official protocol includes both versions in its stability exercises: the single-leg RDL and single-leg toe touch.": "Bryanov službeni protokol uključuje obje verzije u svojim vježbama stabilnosti: RDL s jednom nogom i dodir prstima s jednom nogom.",
  "Bryan’s official warm-up uses arm circles, leg swings, high knees and lateral lunges. Hip CARs and the lunge with twist come from his mobility day and his 2025 warm-up with Dr. Andy Galpin.": "Bryanovo službeno zagrijavanje koristi krugove rukama, zamahe nogama, visoka koljena i bočne iskorake. Hip CARs i iskorak s uvijanjem dolaze iz njegovog dana mobilnosti i njegova zagrijavanja 2025. s dr. Andyjem Galpinom.",
  "Bryan’s official yoga block includes cat-cow, cobbler’s pose, tree pose and cobra. Stay longer when you have time; his version lasts 15 min.": "Bryanov službeni blok joge uključuje mačku-kravu, pozu postolara, pozu stabla i kobru. Ostani dulje kad imaš vremena; njegova verzija traje 15 min.",
  "Bryan’s physical-therapist exercise #1. Official wording (2026): “With weights in your hands, bring your shoulders up and out. Keep your elbows back. Do 1 set to fatigue 2 times a week.” He uses about 9 kg (20 lb); his posture coach’s patients usually start near 3.5 kg (8 lb).": "Bryanova fizioterapeutska vježba #1. Službena formulacija (2026.): \"S utezima u rukama, podignite ramena i ispružite ih. Držite laktove unazad. Radite 1 seriju do umora 2 puta tjedno.\" Koristi oko 9 kg (20 lb); pacijenti njegovog trenera držanja obično počinju s težinom od oko 3,5 kg (8 lb).",
  "Bryan’s physical-therapist exercise #2. Official wording (2026): “With a hand on your forehead, resist the pressure of your hand pushing your head back. When doing this, be very patient.” He does it to fatigue twice a week.": "Bryanova fizioterapeutska vježba #2. Službena formulacija (2026.): \"S rukom na čelu, oduprite se pritisku ruke koja gura glavu unazad. Kad to radite, budite vrlo strpljivi.\" Radi to do umora dvaput tjedno.",
  "Bryan’s posture coach walks him through the neck and shoulder exercises.": "Bryanov trener držanja vodi ga kroz vježbe za vrat i ramena.",
  "Bryan's protocol and home alternatives": "Bryanov protokol i kućne alternative",
  "Bryan’s protocol: at least 150 min a week of moderate activity (Zone 2) during which you can hold a conversation.": "Bryanov protokol: najmanje 150 min tjedno umjerene aktivnosti (zona 2) tijekom koje možete voditi razgovor.",
  "Bryan's protocol: mechanical shock signals osteoblasts to deposit minerals. Keep knees slightly soft to protect cartilage while the bone absorbs the force.": "Bryanov protokol: mehanički šok signalizira osteoblastima da talože minerale. Držite koljena lagano mekana kako biste zaštitili hrskavicu dok kost apsorbira silu.",
  "Bryan’s published options for bodyweight HIIT: jumping jacks, high knees, mountain climbers, burpees without the push-up, jump squats, plus marching and bodyweight squats for beginners.": "Bryanove objavljene opcije za HIIT s tjelesnom težinom: jumping jacks, high knees, mountain climbers, burpees bez sklekova, skakački čučnjevi, plus marširanje i čučnjevi s tjelesnom težinom za početnike.",
  "Bryan's rule: injury prevention comes first. Swap to the easier variant whenever a joint complains; never train through sharp pain.": "Bryanovo pravilo: prevencija ozljeda je na prvom mjestu. Prijeđite na lakšu varijantu kad god se zglob žali; nikada ne trenirajte kroz oštru bol.",
  "Bryan's video or post": "Bryanov videozapis ili objava",
