  "Try themes live": "Isprobajte teme uživo",
  "Try themes live in Settings → Appearance: opens Today with a small switcher floating at the top of the screen, one letter per theme (A Original to G Course). Hover a letter to see its name, keep using any page while you compare, and close it with × (or Escape). It stays open across pages and reloads until you close it.": "Try themes live in Settings → Appearance: opens Today with a small switcher floating at the top of the screen, one letter per theme (A Original to G Course). Zadržite pokazivač miša nad slovom da vidite njegovo ime, nastavite koristiti bilo koju stranicu dok uspoređujete i zatvorite je tipkom × (ili Escape). Ostaje otvoren na svim stranicama i ponovno se učitava dok ga ne zatvorite.",
  "Tuck the pelvis and squeeze the back glute first.": "Uvucite zdjelicu i prvo stisnite stražnji gluteus.",
