  "Tue": "uto",
  "Tuesday": "utorak",
  "Tuesday in Bryan’s newest weekly template (exercise newsletter, 4 Oct 2026): 8 rounds of 20 s efforts with 40 s rest for beginners, then moderate cardio. Day 2 of his official protocol uses 20 s all-out with 20 s rest. These bursts are where most of your near-max minutes come from.": "Tuesday in Bryan’s newest weekly template (exercise newsletter, 4 Oct 2026): 8 rounds of 20 s efforts with 40 s rest for beginners, then moderate cardio. Drugi dan njegovog službenog protokola koristi 20 s all-out s 20 s odmora. Iz ovih rafala dolazi većina vaših skoro maksimalnih minuta.",
